  "plain": "This story is about David Grusch, a former US intelligence officer, testifying before Congress about UFOs. The podcast host Jesse Michels says Grusch testified in Washington, D.C., in late July 2023, and in another episode gives the exact date as July 26, 2023. Michels stresses that Grusch spoke under oath and that he was describing what he had found, which, as told elsewhere, is that the government holds craft not made by humans. James Fox, a UFO investigator, also tells it on the same podcast. He says he watched the testimony live on his phone and describes Grusch speaking under oath to a group of lawmakers from both parties. If true, it would mean a former official was willing to tell Congress, at risk to himself, that such secrets exist."
